<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 27.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 27.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Thursday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				  Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   McIntosh Sec	   11.54     0.78</p>
<p> 2   Prime Credit Tr	10.54     0.93</p>
<p> 3   Villa World	    10.28     1.07</p>
<p> 4   Prop Income Inv	10.11     1.01</p>
<p> 5   Indu Property	  10.11     0.90</p>
<p> 6   BT Prop Trust	   9.77     1.67</p>
<p> 7   Central Equity	  9.47     0.95</p>
<p> 8   Colonial Mutual	 9.36     1.13</p>
<p> 9   Centro Prop	     9.07     2.15</p>
<p>10   Armstrong Retail	8.92     0.74</p>
<p>11   Gandel Retail Tr	8.86     0.88</p>
<p>12   Aust Tour		 8.82     0.85</p>
<p>13   Gen Prop Tr	     8.82     2.28</p>
<p>14   Barclays Mirvac	 8.80     1.25</p>
<p>15   Westpac Prop Tr	 8.74     1.55</p>
<p>16   Equitilink		8.62     0.58</p>
